# Table-machine build overrides. Loaded in addition to `.env` / `.env.local`
# when Vite is run with `--mode collab` (see 02-mode-gating.md).
# All other VITE_* vars (map/backend/geoserver URLs, keys) still come from
# .env / .env.local — this file only flips the Collab module on.
VITE_COLLAB_MODE="true"
